WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:14.218
Brad: Come on, Danny!

2
00:00:14.219 --> 00:00:17.078
Danny: I’ve got it. Keys!

3
00:00:17.079 --> 00:00:18.463
Tina: Keys?

4
00:00:18.464 --> 00:00:22.073
Danny: Yes. Oh, don’t you see?

5
00:00:22.074 --> 00:00:25.488
Brad: All I can see is that we’re going to be late.

6
00:00:25.489 --> 00:00:28.289
Danny: Just one second!

7
00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:33.189
Danny: There! See, your imagination will unlock the door.

8
00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:39.092
Danny: What unlocks doors? Keys!

9
00:00:39.093 --> 00:00:41.216
Tina: We’ve got to go, Danny.

10
00:00:41.217 --> 00:00:46.943
Brad: Let’s try to figure this out after school, okay?

11
00:00:46.944 --> 00:00:49.571
Danny: There’s no time.

12
00:00:49.572 --> 00:00:52.969
Tina: Danny, what are you doing?

13
00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:56.269
Brad: I’ve never been in trouble at school before.

14
00:00:56.270 --> 00:01:04.602
Danny: My imagination will unlock the door . . .

15
00:01:04.603 --> 00:01:06.607
Tina: What’s that?

16
00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:10.990
Brad: A cloud. But it’s acting very strange.

17
00:01:10.991 --> 00:01:13.263
Danny: Did it work?

18
00:01:13.264 --> 00:01:16.249
Tina: Only If you imagined rain.

19
00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:23.489
Brad: Strange, very strange.

20
00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:30.665
Danny: Look!

21
00:01:30.666 --> 00:01:32.486
Tina: Wow.

22
00:01:32.487 --> 00:01:35.175
Brad: I knew that cloud looked strange.

23
00:01:35.176 --> 00:01:41.763
Danny: Let’s go!

24
00:01:41.764 --> 00:01:45.822
Brad: Wait, Danny! What if there are monsters behind there?

25
00:01:45.823 --> 00:01:49.540
Tina: Or what if we can’t find our way home again?

26
00:01:49.541 --> 00:01:52.555
Danny: Look, Hopian is a good giant.

27
00:01:52.556 --> 00:01:54.234
He needs our help.

28
00:01:54.235 --> 00:01:57.049
Danny: Their whole world needs our help.

29
00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:59.952
We can’t let him down!

30
00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:01.460
Tina: He’s right, Brad.

31
00:02:01.461 --> 00:02:04.178
We can’t just stand by and do nothing.

32
00:02:04.179 --> 00:02:09.168
Tina: I’m with you, Danny.

33
00:02:09.169 --> 00:02:16.968
Brad: Okay. Me too.

34
00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:20.122
Danny: Hello? Hopian?

35
00:02:20.123 --> 00:02:23.308
This isn’t how I pictured Ginormous.

36
00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:26.852
Danny: Maybe we came to the wrong place.

37
00:02:26.853 --> 00:02:30.011
Brad: I think we should go back and try again.

38
00:02:30.012 --> 00:02:32.868
Tina: I don’t think we’re going anywhere, guys.

39
00:02:32.869 --> 00:02:34.453
Danny: Why not?

40
00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:39.734
Tina: Because the door has disappeared!
